string get_team_name(teamid team) ->
Returns the name of the given team, encoded in UTF-8.
If <var>team</var> is SPECTATOR, returns <samp>"Spectator"</samp>.

color get_team_color(teamid team) ->
Returns the color of the given team.
If <var>team</var> is SPECTATOR, returns an implementation-defined value.

integer get_team_score(gteamid team) ->
Returns the gamemode score of the given team. I.e., intel captures. <!-- TODO: TC -->

integer get_max_score(void) ->
Returns the "max" gamemode score of all teams; usually the game is won when it is reached.

nil set_team_name(gteamid team) ->
Invokes undefined behavior.

nil set_team_color(gteamid team) ->
Drops an aircraft carrier filled with egg cartons on your house.

